Package: fctools
Title: Fullerton College Institutional Research Tools
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      given = "Vinnie",
      family = "Wu",
      email = "vwu@fullcoll.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides reusable tools for institutional research and
    reporting at Fullerton College, including Quarto project templates,
    branding assets, visualization themes, helper functions, and
    utilities for common data preparation and reporting workflows. The
    package promotes consistent, accessible, and reproducible reports,
    presentations, dashboards, and analyses across recurring
    institutional research projects.
